       "id": "Q0GGX2"
      },
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "21573134"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Interacts with DNTTIP1 (PubMed:21573134). Identified in a complex with KCDT19, HDAC1 and HSPA2 (By similarity). Component of a histone deacetylase complex containing DNTTIP1, ZNF541, HDAC1 and HDAC2 (PubMed:21573134). Identified in a complex with HDAC1, HDAC2, DNTTIP1 and KCTD19 (By similarity)"
    }
   ],
